<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Automation &amp; Observability on AWS FCJ Capstone Report - Nguyen Ngoc Tuan Khanh</title><link>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/en/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/5-automation-and-observability/</link><description>Recent content in Automation &amp; Observability on AWS FCJ Capstone Report - Nguyen Ngoc Tuan Khanh</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/en/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/5-automation-and-observability/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Create EventBridge Scheduler for Daily Ingestion</title><link>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/en/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/5-automation-and-observability/5.1-schedule-daily-ingestion/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/en/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/5-automation-and-observability/5.1-schedule-daily-ingestion/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;EventBridge Scheduler triggers the Glue Python Shell Job daily. Do does not schedule transformation/loader jobs simultaneously as they must wait for upstream completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Step&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Action&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Technical Details&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;EventBridge → Scheduler → &lt;strong&gt;create schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;create recurring schedule&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Schedule name&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;stock-screener-daily-ingestion&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Schedule pattern&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Select a cron-based schedule&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Expression&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Example: &lt;code&gt;cron(0 7 ? * TUE-SAT *)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Timezone&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Select &lt;code&gt;Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh&lt;/code&gt; if supported by the UI&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;6&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Target&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Universal target: AWS SDK → Glue → &lt;code&gt;StartJobRun&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Input payload&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Paste the JSON below&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Execution role&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;EventBridgeSchedulerStockScreenerRole&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;9&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;create schedule&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Verify schedule Enabled&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;JobName&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;us-stock-daily-ingestion&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>